			},
			"popup": {
				"text": "**Summit**\nBalmat and Paccard stood on top on 8 August 1786 at 18:23, and stayed for 33 minutes. The climb won the prize that Horace-Bénédict de Saussure had offered in 1760, and is seen as the start of modern mountaineering."
			}
